/* ================= 11. 右侧辅助面板（总览、审查、终端）：精准隔离、字体提亮与消除终端黑底 ================= */
/* 
 * 1. 严格限定选择器，仅对真正的右侧辅助面板生效，绝不污染左侧主会话区；
 * 2. 彻底解决终端右侧终端会话（pwsh.exe 选中项/hover 项）深黑色实底色块问题，统一为通透微光浮层；
 * 3. 将总览 (Overview)、审查 (Review)、终端 (Terminal) 面板内部字体明度在原有基础上升高约 20 个百分点。
 */

/* 11.1 右侧辅助面板整体外层容器通透微光 (精确限定选择器，严密排除主会话窗口) */
aside[class*="auxiliary"],
[class*="auxiliaryPane"],
[data-testid*="auxiliary-pane"],
[class*="ArtifactViewer"],
[data-testid="running-items-panel"],
div[class*="group/pane"]:not(:has([data-testid="conversation-view"])):has([data-testid*="terminal"]),
div[class*="group/pane"]:not(:has([data-testid="conversation-view"])):has([class*="xterm"]),
div[class*="group/pane"]:not(:has([data-testid="conversation-view"])):has([data-testid*="diff"]),
div[class*="group/pane"]:not(:has([data-testid="conversation-view"])):has([data-testid*="review"]),
div[class*="group/pane"]:not(:has([data-testid="conversation-view"])):has([data-testid*="overview"]) {
    background-color: rgba(12, 19, 16, 0.60) !important;
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px) !important;
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px) !important;
    border-left: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08) !important;
}

/* 11.2 终端右侧终端会话列表（pwsh.exe 选中项与列表项）黑底彻底消除与微光美化 */
/* 平时/未选中状态：纯净透明底色 */
[data-testid*="terminal-item"],
div[class*="terminal-item"],
div[data-testid*="terminal-group"] > div,
div:has(> [data-testid*="terminal-item"]) {
    background-color: transparent !important;
    background: transparent !important;
}

/* 选中项（pwsh.exe 激活项）：强效消除原生 bg-secondary 深黑底，呈现通透高雅的半透明白色微光浮层与高亮边框 */
[data-testid*="terminal-item"].bg-secondary,
[data-testid*="terminal-item"][class*="bg-secondary"],
[data-testid*="terminal-item"][data-state="active"],
[data-testid*="terminal-item"][aria-selected="true"],
[data-testid*="terminal-item"][data-active="true"],
div[class*="terminal-item"].bg-secondary,
div[class*="terminal-item"][class*="bg-secondary"] {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12) !important;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12) !important;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22) !important;
    border-radius: 6px !important;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15) !important;
}

/* 终端会话选中项内部文本与图标直接保持亮白 */
[data-testid*="terminal-item"].bg-secondary *,
[data-testid*="terminal-item"][class*="bg-secondary"] * {
    color: #ffffff !important;
}

/* 终端会话悬停状态：覆盖原生 hover:bg-muted 深黑色，统一为轻盈柔和的白色微光 */
[data-testid*="terminal-item"]:hover,
[data-testid*="terminal-item"].hover\:bg-muted:hover,
div[class*="terminal-item"]:hover {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08) !important;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08) !important;
    border-radius: 6px !important;
}

/* 终端未选中会话文本与图标明度拉升 20 (原来 61% -> 现 82%) */
[data-testid*="terminal-item"] span,
[data-testid*="terminal-item"] div,
[data-testid*="terminal-item"] svg,
[data-testid*="terminal-item"] {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82) !important;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased !important;
}

/* 11.2.1 总览面板（Overview）中的终端会话列表项（pwsh.exe / PID 条目）黑底彻底消除与微光美化 */
/*
 * 彻底消除 Overview 面板下“终端会话”折叠区块中 pwsh.exe 等终端进程条目的突兀深黑实底（bg-secondary / bg-muted / bg-card）。
 * 平时彻底纯透明（透出晨雾森林壁纸，或呈现极轻微光），悬停时微光高亮并显示精致细边框。
 */

/* 1. 总览面板中所有列表项与容器平时状态全面纯透明 */
div.py-3.flex.h-full.w-full.flex-col div.px-2 div.flex.flex-col > div,
div.py-3.flex.h-full.w-full.flex-col div.px-2 div.flex.flex-col > a,
div.py-3.flex.h-full.w-full.flex-col div.px-2 div.flex.flex-col > button,
div.py-3.flex.h-full.w-full.flex-col div[class*="w-full"]:has(button:has(span)) div.px-2 > div > *,
div[class*="group/pane"] div.w-full.flex.flex-col.gap-2 div.px-2 > div > *,
[data-testid*="auxiliary"] div.w-full.flex.flex-col.gap-2 div.px-2 > div > *,
/* 终端专属类名与包含 PID 的条目 */
[data-testid*="terminal-session"],
[data-testid*="terminal-row"],
[data-testid*="terminal-instance"],
[data-testid*="terminal-process"],
[data-testid*="session-row"],
[data-testid*="terminal-pill"],
[class*="terminal-session"],
[class*="terminal-row"],
[class*="terminal-instance"],
[class*="terminal-process"],
:where([data-testid*="auxiliary"], div[class*="group/pane"]:not(:has([data-testid="conversation-view"]))) div[class*="rounded"]:has(span:not(:empty)):has(svg):has(button),
:where([data-testid*="auxiliary"], div[class*="group/pane"]:not(:has([data-testid="conversation-view"]))) div.flex.items-center.justify-between[class*="rounded"]:has(svg) {
    background-color: transparent !important;
    background: transparent !important;
    backdrop-filter: none !important;
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: none !important;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10) !important;
    border-radius: 8px !important;
    box-shadow: none !important;
    transition: background-color 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease !important;
}

/* 2. 悬停状态：覆盖原生深黑底色，呈现通透高雅的半透明白色微光浮层 */
div.py-3.flex.h-full.w-full.flex-col div.px-2 div.flex.flex-col > div:hover,
div.py-3.flex.h-full.w-full.flex-col div.px-2 div.flex.flex-col > a:hover,
div.py-3.flex.h-full.w-full.flex-col div.px-2 div.flex.flex-col > button:hover,
div.py-3.flex.h-full.w-full.flex-col div[class*="w-full"]:has(button:has(span)) div.px-2 > div > *:hover,
div[class*="group/pane"] div.w-full.flex.flex-col.gap-2 div.px-2 > div > *:hover,
[data-testid*="auxiliary"] div.w-full.flex.flex-col.gap-2 div.px-2 > div > *:hover,
[data-testid*="terminal-session"]:hover,
[data-testid*="terminal-row"]:hover,
[data-testid*="terminal-instance"]:hover,
[data-testid*="terminal-process"]:hover,
[data-testid*="session-row"]:hover,
[data-testid*="terminal-pill"]:hover,
[class*="terminal-session"]:hover,
[class*="terminal-row"]:hover,
[class*="terminal-instance"]:hover,
[class*="terminal-process"]:hover,
:where([data-testid*="auxiliary"], div[class*="group/pane"]:not(:has([data-testid="conversation-view"]))) div[class*="rounded"]:has(span:not(:empty)):has(svg):has(button):hover,
:where([data-testid*="auxiliary"], div[class*="group/pane"]:not(:has([data-testid="conversation-view"]))) div.flex.items-center.justify-between[class*="rounded"]:has(svg):hover {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10) !important;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10) !important;
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22) !important;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12) !important;
}

/* 3. 终端会话条目内部文字与图标明度增强（pwsh.exe、PID数字、操作按钮） */
div.w-full.flex.flex-col.gap-2 div.px-2 span,
div.w-full.flex.flex-col.gap-2 div.px-2 div,
div.w-full.flex.flex-col.gap-2 div.px-2 svg,
[data-testid*="terminal-session"] *,
[class*="terminal-session"] * {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.90) !important;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased !important;
}

/* PID 次要标签（PID 34996）保持优雅次级亮灰，外跳图标悬停高亮 */
div.w-full.flex.flex-col.gap-2 div.px-2 span[class*="opacity-"],
div.w-full.flex.flex-col.gap-2 div.px-2 span[class*="muted"] {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.70) !important;
}

div.w-full.flex.flex-col.gap-2 div.px-2 button:hover svg,
div.w-full.flex.flex-col.gap-2 div.px-2 a:hover svg {
    color: #ffffff !important;
}

/* 11.3 右侧辅助面板顶部导航 Tab（button[data-tab-id] 及顶部控制图标）消除黑底与明度增强 */
[class*="auxiliary"] button,
[class*="auxiliaryPane"] button,
[data-testid*="auxiliary"] button,
[data-testid="aux-panel-plus-dropdown-trigger"],
[data-aux-pane-open] button[data-tab-id] {
    background-color: transparent !important;
    background: transparent !important;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85) !important;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased !important;
}

[class*="auxiliary"] button:hover,
[class*="auxiliaryPane"] button:hover,
[data-testid*="auxiliary"] button:hover,
[data-testid="aux-panel-plus-dropdown-trigger"]:hover,
[data-aux-pane-open] button[data-tab-id]:hover {
    color: #ffffff !important;
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10) !important;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10) !important;
}

/* 右侧面板顶部当前激活的 Tab 标签：覆盖原生 bg-secondary / bg-muted 纯黑块，改为柔和白色半透明微光 */
[data-aux-pane-open] button[data-tab-id].bg-secondary,
[data-aux-pane-open] button[data-tab-id].bg-muted,
[data-aux-pane-open] button[data-tab-id][aria-selected="true"],
[data-aux-pane-open] button[data-tab-id][data-active="true"] {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16) !important;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16) !important;
    color: #ffffff !important;
}

/* 11.3.1 右侧边栏新建标签页 (aux-pane-new-tab-view)、快捷入口 (审查/Open File/终端/内置浏览器)、搜索结果及总览列表行 (Background Commands / Artifacts / Modified Files 等) 彻底消除选中与悬停黑底 */

/* 1. 顶部搜索框 (Search tabs, files, extensions...) 清透微光美化与文字提亮 */
[data-testid="new-tab-search-input"] {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06) !important;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06) !important;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18) !important;
    border-radius: 8px !important;
    color: #ffffff !important;
    box-shadow: none !important;
    transition: background-color 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease !important;
}

[data-testid="new-tab-search-input"]::placeholder {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65) !important;
}

[data-testid="new-tab-search-input"]:focus {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10) !important;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10) !important;
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.32) !important;
}

div:has(> [data-testid="new-tab-search-input"]) svg {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72) !important;
}

/* 内嵌搜索结果列表容器保持纯透明，防止被全局浮动 listbox 规则赋予深色背景卡片 */
[data-testid="aux-pane-new-tab-view"] div[role="listbox"] {
    background-color: transparent !important;
    background: transparent !important;
    backdrop-filter: none !important;
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: none !important;
    border: none !important;
    box-shadow: none !important;
    z-index: auto !important;
}

/* 2. 右侧边栏所有功能项、搜索结果项与 PanelItemRow 行平时状态：纯透明无黑底无边框 */
[data-aux-pane-open] [data-testid^="new-tab-card-"],
[data-aux-pane-open] [data-testid^="new-tab-result-"],
[data-aux-pane-open] [data-testid^="overview-panel-row-"],
[data-aux-pane-open] [data-testid="overview-decorator-row"],
[data-aux-pane-open] [data-testid="background-task-row"],
[data-aux-pane-open] [data-testid="artifact-row"],
[data-aux-pane-open] [data-testid="change-row"],
[data-aux-pane-open] [data-testid="changed-file-row"],
[data-aux-pane-open] [data-testid="sidecar-row"],
[data-aux-pane-open] [data-testid^="accumulated-item-"],
:is([data-testid="aux-pane-new-tab-view"], [data-testid="overview-panel"], [data-aux-pane-open] [data-testid^="overview-"]) :is(button, a, div[role="button"], [class*="hover:bg-secondary"], [class*="hover:bg-muted"], [class*="group-hover:bg-secondary"], [class*="group-hover:bg-muted"]):not([data-testid="new-tab-search-input"]) {
    background-color: transparent !important;
    background: transparent !important;
    border: none !important;
    border-color: transparent !important;
    box-shadow: none !important;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.86) !important;
    border-radius: 8px !important;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased !important;
    transition: background-color 0.16s ease, color 0.16s ease !important;
}

/* 3. 鼠标悬停 (:hover) 与选中激活 (aria-selected / aria-current / bg-secondary / bg-muted) 状态：彻底消除纯黑长条，呈现柔和白色半透明微光 */
[data-aux-pane-open] [data-testid^="new-tab-card-"]:is(:hover, :focus-visible),
[data-aux-pane-open] [data-testid^="new-tab-result-"]:is(:hover, :focus-visible, [aria-selected="true"], .bg-secondary, .bg-muted),
[data-aux-pane-open] [data-testid^="overview-panel-row-"]:is(:hover, :focus-visible, [aria-current="true"], .bg-secondary, .bg-muted),
[data-aux-pane-open] .group:hover > [data-testid^="overview-panel-row-"],
[data-aux-pane-open] [data-testid="overview-decorator-row"]:is(:hover, :focus-visible, [aria-current="true"], .bg-secondary, .bg-muted),
[data-aux-pane-open] .group:hover > [data-testid="overview-decorator-row"],
[data-aux-pane-open] [data-testid="background-task-row"]:is(:hover, :focus-visible, [aria-current="true"], .bg-secondary, .bg-muted),
[data-aux-pane-open] .group:hover > [data-testid="background-task-row"],
[data-aux-pane-open] [data-testid="artifact-row"]:is(:hover, :focus-visible, [aria-current="true"], .bg-secondary, .bg-muted),
[data-aux-pane-open] .group:hover > [data-testid="artifact-row"],
[data-aux-pane-open] [data-testid="change-row"]:is(:hover, :focus-visible, [aria-current="true"], .bg-secondary, .bg-muted),
[data-aux-pane-open] .group:hover > [data-testid="change-row"],
[data-aux-pane-open] [data-testid="changed-file-row"]:is(:hover, :focus-visible, [aria-current="true"], .bg-secondary, .bg-muted),
[data-aux-pane-open] .group:hover > [data-testid="changed-file-row"],
[data-aux-pane-open] [data-testid="sidecar-row"]:is(:hover, :focus-visible, [aria-current="true"], .bg-secondary, .bg-muted),
[data-aux-pane-open] .group:hover > [data-testid="sidecar-row"],
[data-aux-pane-open] [data-testid^="accumulated-item-"]:is(:hover, :focus-visible, [aria-current="true"], .bg-secondary, .bg-muted),
[data-aux-pane-open] .group:hover > [data-testid^="accumulated-item-"],
:is([data-testid="aux-pane-new-tab-view"], [data-testid="overview-panel"], [data-aux-pane-open] [data-testid^="overview-"]) :is(button, a, div[role="button"], [class*="hover:bg-secondary"], [class*="hover:bg-muted"]):not([data-testid="new-tab-search-input"]):is(:hover, :focus-visible, [aria-selected="true"], [aria-current="true"], .bg-secondary, .bg-muted),
:is([data-testid="aux-pane-new-tab-view"], [data-testid="overview-panel"], [data-aux-pane-open] [data-testid^="overview-"]) .group:hover > :is([class*="group-hover:bg-secondary"], [class*="group-hover:bg-muted"]) {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14) !important;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14) !important;
    color: #ffffff !important;
    border: none !important;
    border-color: transparent !important;
    box-shadow: none !important;
}

/* 防止外层 .group[class*="hover:bg-secondary"] 与内层子按钮同时叠加两层半透明微光 */
:is([data-testid="aux-pane-new-tab-view"], [data-testid="overview-panel"], [data-aux-pane-open] [data-testid^="overview-"]) .group:is([class*="hover:bg-secondary"], [class*="hover:bg-muted"]):hover > :is(button, a, div[role="button"]) {
    background-color: transparent !important;
    background: transparent !important;
}

/* 悬停与选中项内部的图标和普通文字同步提亮为纯白（保留代码变更 +N/-M 绿红语义着色与状态色） */
:is(
    [data-testid^="new-tab-card-"]:hover,
    [data-testid^="new-tab-result-"]:is(:hover, [aria-selected="true"]),
    [data-testid^="overview-panel-row-"]:is(:hover, [aria-current="true"]),
    .group:hover > [data-testid^="overview-panel-row-"],
    [data-testid="overview-decorator-row"]:is(:hover, [aria-current="true"]),
    .group:hover > [data-testid="overview-decorator-row"],
    [data-testid="background-task-row"]:is(:hover, [aria-current="true"]),
    .group:hover > [data-testid="background-task-row"],
    [data-testid="artifact-row"]:is(:hover, [aria-current="true"]),
    .group:hover > [data-testid="artifact-row"],
    [data-testid="change-row"]:is(:hover, [aria-current="true"]),
    .group:hover > [data-testid="change-row"],
    [data-testid="changed-file-row"]:is(:hover, [aria-current="true"]),
    .group:hover > [data-testid="changed-file-row"],
    [data-testid^="accumulated-item-"]:is(:hover, [aria-current="true"]),
    .group:hover > [data-testid^="accumulated-item-"]
) *:not([class*="text-green"]):not([class*="text-emerald"]):not([class*="text-red"]):not([class*="text-rose"]):not([class*="text-amber"]):not([class*="text-yellow"]) {
    color: #ffffff !important;
}

/* 4. 彻底清除列表项右侧悬浮操作区与顶部 Tab 关闭按钮容器的内联 linear-gradient(..., var(--secondary)/var(--muted) 25%) 黑色渐变遮罩 */
[data-aux-pane-open] div[style*="var(--secondary)"],
[data-aux-pane-open] div[style*="var(--muted)"],
[data-testid="aux-pane-new-tab-view"] div[style*="var(--secondary)"],
[data-aux-pane-open] .group > div.absolute[style*="linear-gradient"],
[data-aux-pane-open] button[data-tab-id] div[style*="linear-gradient"] {
    background: transparent !important;
    background-color: transparent !important;
    background-image: none !important;
}

/* 分组小标题（如 Background Commands）与计数圆徽章微光提亮 */
[data-testid="aux-pane-new-tab-view"] [data-testid^="new-tab-group-"],
[data-aux-pane-open] span.bg-border.rounded-full {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85) !important;
}

[data-aux-pane-open] span.bg-border.rounded-full {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16) !important;
    opacity: 0.9 !important;
}

/* 11.4 总览面板 (Overview / Outline / 制品列表)：字体明度加 20 (拉升至 88% ~ 95%) */
[data-testid*="overview"],
[data-testid*="outline"],
[class*="overview"],
[class*="ArtifactViewer"],
[class*="ArtifactViewer"] p,
[class*="ArtifactViewer"] span,
[class*="ArtifactViewer"] li {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88) !important;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased !important;
}

[data-testid*="overview"] h1,
[data-testid*="overview"] h2,
[data-testid*="overview"] h3,
[data-testid*="overview"] h4,
[class*="ArtifactViewer"] h1,
[class*="ArtifactViewer"] h2,
[class*="ArtifactViewer"] h3 {
    color: #ffffff !important;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased !important;
}

/* 11.5 审查面板 (Review / Diff / 变更文件审查)：代码与文字明度加 20 (拉升至 90% ~ 95%) */
[data-testid*="review"],
[data-testid*="diff"],
[class*="review"],
[class*="diff"],
[data-testid*="review"] p,
[data-testid*="review"] span:not(.text-green-500):not(.text-red-500),
[data-testid*="diff"] span:not(.text-green-500):not(.text-red-500) {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.90) !important;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased !important;
}

/* 11.6 终端面板 (Terminal / xterm)：控制台底色通透、高亮字体与全量 ANSI 色彩保留 */
.terminal,
.xterm,
.xterm-viewport,
.xterm-screen,
[class*="terminal"] {
    background-color: transparent !important;
    background: transparent !important;
}

/* 11.6.0 彻底消除终端激活后底层穿透的常驻 Loading 旋转动画与占位图层 */
[data-testid="terminal-active"] > div.pointer-events-none,
[data-testid="terminal-active"] .animate-spin {
